<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<document signature="Hero Lab Data">
  <loadonce key="Codex Omdura Class"/>

  <!--
    Omdura (base class) — Pathfinder RPG: Niobe (Paizo 2019)
    Rules: https://www.d20pfsrd.com/classes/base-classes/omdura/
    Codex HL pack 2026-07-28

    Scope / honesty notes for Hero Lab:
    - Chassis, SPD, spells known, features, tracking, and choosers are implemented.
    - Spell list is spontaneous divine (Cha). Primary list tags Inquisitor so known-spell
      picking works. Cleric 0–6 spells that are not on the inquisitor list (or that
      appear at a lower inquisitor level) may need to be added via Custom / Adjust as
      Omdura RAW uses the *lower* of the two lists. Full automated dual-list merge is
      not practical in a single .user without core edits.
    - Divine Touch reuses paladin Lay on Hands math patterns; mercies/cruelties use
      custom choosers that point at stock paladin mercy / antipaladin cruelty categories
      when available.
    - Divine Weapon lists abilities as text + a use tracker; apply the +enhancement in
      Adjust or on the weapon as needed for full automation of each special.
  -->

